  "Issued",
  "It compares complete plans, not placements. Fewest unplaced pieces wins first, then fewest sheets, then utilization. The plate pattern you choose is applied only after those limits are equal, which is why no pattern can trade a sheet for its own preference.",
  "It does not drive your cutting machine directly. The optimizer exports machine-readable files — Bottero .OPT, Intermac .ISO, Lisec .DAT and generic DXF — for the equipment's own software to run.",
  "It does not file tax returns. The VAT Submission report prepares the figures for a period; filing is done by a person.",
  "It is a conversation about funding a product that exists and is in use, and it is not an offer or a solicitation of investment. No shares, no instruments, no forecast. If funding is what interests you, the first email gets the build's real state — including what is unfinished — before any terms are discussed.",
  "It is not a cloud service. There is no web dashboard, no tenant and no online account.",
  "It is not a CRM. Inquiries and customers are recorded so quotations can be built from them, not for pipeline or campaign management.",
  "It keeps running. ProGlass is a Windows desktop application with a local SQLite database, licensed rather than rented — there is no server that has to stay up and no account that expires. What would stop is maintenance and new work, which is the honest reason this page exists.",
