  "Production rows",
  "Production runs exclusively from job orders, and a job order only exists for a confirmed proforma — a draft never reaches the floor. From there the job is distributed across the eight stages: every piece enters at Cutting, and only the pieces a station completes arrive at the next one. A station cannot record work it never received.",
