  "Six ways in, none of them a donation.",
  "Six working documents sit at the root of the repository, each written before the change it describes: symptom, scope, file and line. They are the project's memory, and they are the reason a decision made in September can still be argued about in October.",
  "Sixteen databases sit behind the application, one EF Core context each, with additive-only migrations. The backup set copies all of them plus settings into one timestamped folder; restore never overwrites without taking a safety snapshot first. The four family buttons below are the real control — pressing one re-themes this website as well as describing the application.",
  "Size",
  "Size rows: piece reference, size (W × H mm), pieces",
  "Sizes",
  "Sizing, pricing, wastage allowances, delivery charges, the same build-up priced again for a different customer. Estimating glass is not difficult arithmetic — it is a lot of small numbers held in the head at once, every day, on paper. That is where the mistakes lived, and it was clear which parts of the day kept going wrong.",
