  "The cutting plan has to be cuttable",
  "The cutting plan is drawn by hand, or a guillotine is set by feel. Whether the plan is any good is only visible once the sheets are on the table.",
  "The data was not lost in the binding",
  "The default winner. A fuller first sheet does not replace it.",
  "The defining property of this application is that a job can be followed from the enquiry that started it to the money it made. Everything on this page exists because the software keeps those links — not because anyone wrote a summary of them.",
  "The delivery note is created as Dispatching and carries only what actually leaves. Batch 1 is the ten Clear Tempered lines; the tinted and Low-E pieces stay on the job with their full quantity as balance, waiting for Batch 2.",
  "The delivery note records the movement, the balance drops, and what is still owed stays visible on the job. A second movement later opens against the same balance rather than starting a new one.",
  "The Delivery Note tracker reached its safe read limit. Narrow the workbook or filters before exporting to avoid an incomplete file.",
