  "This website contains no customer count, no award, no certification and no percentage improvement claim, because the repository contains none of those things. Where a screen capture does not yet exist, the page says so instead of showing an illustration labelled as a screenshot.",
  "This website does not run analytics, advertising tags, session recording or third-party trackers. It does not set advertising or profiling cookies. Typefaces are self-hosted, so visiting a page does not call a font service.",
  "This website is not an application. There is no account to create, no online trial to start and no dashboard to log in to. ProGlass Automation is Windows software that you install and activate offline — the trial starts on your machine, not in a browser.",
